{"approved":false,"back_sample":{"translation":"For a moving wave, the velocity v is equal to the frequency f multiplied by the wavelength λ. If you know two positive values, you can calculate the third, provided that all quantities describe the same wave in the same medium.","truncated":false},"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"frequency-wavelength-calculator UI copy.additionalFaqs.0.answer","detected_language":"nl","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"frequency-wavelength-calculator.copy.additionalFaqs.0.answer","keys":["frequency-wavelength-calculator.copy.additionalFaqs.0.answer"],"locale":"nl","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"Voor een zich voortbewegende golf is de snelheid v gelijk aan de frequentie f vermenigvuldigd met de golflengte λ. Als je twee positieve waarden kent, kun je de derde berekenen, mits alle grootheden dezelfde golf in hetzelfde medium beschrijven.","record_id":"1e8914d4389c75e5c1e1ce1026719e860ddcda7282ac2bb84bab62f1a7723728","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40843674935","seconds":3.0411131002500014,"source":"For a traveling wave, speed v equals frequency f multiplied by wavelength λ. If you know any two positive values, you can calculate the third, provided all quantities describe the same wave in the same medium.","source_commit":"e1f72394198c1a94fce448ea14cd79b496701273","source_hash":"d4ac5a05d203a103b48819f732b9e1af0898a00ad4f775d02e5be6ab02ee594b","status":"machine-draft","translation":"Voor een zich voortbewegende golf is de snelheid v gelijk aan de frequentie f vermenigvuldigd met de golflengte λ. Als je twee positieve waarden kent, kun je de derde berekenen, mits alle grootheden dezelfde golf in hetzelfde medium beschrijven.","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
